-`2026-07-01T00:00:00Z`); `end` must be after `start`.
+day another starts) do not overlap; `start`/`end` must be full timestamps on the hour UTC (e.g.
+`2026-07-01T00:00:00Z`; midnight unless renting by the hour); `end` must be after `start`.
